        "quote": "(a) The doing of any of the acts or things prohibited, made unlawful or a misdemeanor, or the failing to do any of the things commanded to be done, as specified and set forth in this code or in any rules and regulations adopted pursuant to this code, within the jurisdictional limits of the City, shall be deemed an offense against the good order, public peace, morals, health, proper government and welfare of the City.",
