          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.070:block:4",
          "start": 748
        },
        "quote": "(3) Both Fine and Imprisonment. Both fine and imprisonment not to exceed subsections (b)(1) and (b)(2) of this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.070:block:4#text",
